{
  "lang": "en",
  "film": "Accepted",
  "source_rel": "Greatest Acting Monologues Of All Time PART 4/Greatest Acting Monologues Of All Time PART 4.mp4",
  "t_start_global": 3915.46,
  "t_end_global": 4067.1,
  "duration": 151.64,
  "clip": "Accepted.mp4",
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.34,
      "text": "No, I'm not going to answer your question,",
      "filename": "segment001.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 1.42,
      "end": 2.78,
      "text": "because you guys have already made up your minds.",
      "filename": "segment002.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 3.18,
      "end": 5.74,
      "text": "I'm an expert in rejection, and I can see it on your faces.",
      "filename": "segment003.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 6.06,
      "end": 8.24,
      "text": "And it's too bad that you judge us by the way we look",
      "filename": "segment004.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 8.24,
      "end": 9.72,
      "text": "and not by who we are,",
      "filename": "segment005.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 10.6,
      "end": 12.26,
      "text": "just because you want us to be more like them.",
      "filename": "segment006.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 12.52,
      "end": 14.02,
      "text": "When the truth is, we're not like them,",
      "filename": "segment007.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 14.12,
      "end": 16.24,
      "text": "and I am damn proud of that fact.",
      "filename": "segment008.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 23.9,
      "end": 26.6,
      "text": "Harmon College and their 100 years of tradition.",
      "filename": "segment009.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 27.34,
      "end": 28.28,
      "text": "A tradition of what?",
      "filename": "segment010.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 28.68,
      "end": 32.84,
      "text": "Of hazing kids and humiliating anyone who's a little bit different?",
      "filename": "segment011.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 33.7,
      "end": 34.86,
      "text": "Of putting so much pressure on kids,",
      "filename": "segment012.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 34.86,
      "end": 37.34,
      "text": "they turn into these stress freaks and caffeine addicts.",
      "filename": "segment013.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 37.36,
      "end": 40.26,
      "text": "Your phony school demeans real colleges everywhere.",
      "filename": "segment014.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 40.54,
      "end": 42.96,
      "text": "Why? Why can't we both exist? Huh?",
      "filename": "segment015.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 43.34,
      "end": 45.02,
      "text": "You can have your grades and your rules",
      "filename": "segment016.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 45.02,
      "end": 46.48,
      "text": "and your structure and your ivory towers,",
      "filename": "segment017.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 46.72,
      "end": 48.06,
      "text": "and then we'll do things our way.",
      "filename": "segment018.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 48.2,
      "end": 50.04,
      "text": "Why do we have to conform to what you want?",
      "filename": "segment019.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 50.24,
      "end": 51.78,
      "text": "Your curriculum is a joke.",
      "filename": "segment020.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 51.92,
      "end": 53.5,
      "text": "And you, sir, are a criminal.",
      "filename": "segment021.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 53.78,
      "end": 54.74,
      "text": "You know what? You're a criminal,",
      "filename": "segment022.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 54.86,
      "end": 57.06,
      "text": "because you rob these kids of their creativity and their passion.",
      "filename": "segment023.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 57.14,
      "end": 58.14,
      "text": "That's the real crime.",
      "filename": "segment024.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 63.6,
      "end": 64.84,
      "text": "What about you, parents?",
      "filename": "segment025.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 65.02,
      "end": 66.66,
      "text": "Did the system really work out for you?",
      "filename": "segment026.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 67.08,
      "end": 68.58,
      "text": "Did it teach you to follow your heart",
      "filename": "segment027.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 68.58,
      "end": 70.24,
      "text": "or to just play it safe, roll over?",
      "filename": "segment028.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 70.94,
      "end": 71.94,
      "text": "What about you guys?",
      "filename": "segment029.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 72.72,
      "end": 74.24,
      "text": "Did you always want to be school administrators?",
      "filename": "segment030.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 74.6,
      "end": 75.88,
      "text": "Dr. Alexander, was that your dream?",
      "filename": "segment031.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 76.16,
      "end": 78.04,
      "text": "Or maybe no, maybe you wanted to be a poet.",
      "filename": "segment032.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 78.98,
      "end": 80.72,
      "text": "Maybe you wanted to be a magician or an artist.",
      "filename": "segment033.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 81.26,
      "end": 82.62,
      "text": "Maybe you just wanted to travel the world.",
      "filename": "segment034.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 83.44,
      "end": 85.44,
      "text": "Look, I lied to you.",
      "filename": "segment035.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 85.82,
      "end": 87.62,
      "text": "I lied to all of you, and I'm sorry, Dad.",
      "filename": "segment036.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 87.9,
      "end": 88.12,
      "text": "Especially to you.",
      "filename": "segment037.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 88.68,
      "end": 92.14,
      "text": "But out of that desperation, something happened that was so amazing.",
      "filename": "segment038.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 92.34,
      "end": 93.64,
      "text": "It was full of possibilities.",
      "filename": "segment039.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 93.92,
      "end": 96.58,
      "text": "And isn't that what you ultimately want for us as parents?",
      "filename": "segment040.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 96.74,
      "end": 98.62,
      "text": "I mean, it's that, it's possibilities.",
      "filename": "segment041.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 101.72,
      "end": 103.56,
      "text": "Well, we came here today to ask for your approval,",
      "filename": "segment042.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 103.76,
      "end": 105.08,
      "text": "and something just occurred to me.",
      "filename": "segment043.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 105.86,
      "end": 106.64,
      "text": "I don't give a shit.",
      "filename": "segment044.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 108.0,
      "end": 109.46,
      "text": "Who cares about your approval?",
      "filename": "segment045.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 109.52,
      "end": 111.84,
      "text": "We don't need your approval to tell us that what we did was real.",
      "filename": "segment046.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 112.24,
      "end": 114.16,
      "text": "Because there are so few truths in this world",
      "filename": "segment047.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 114.16,
      "end": 115.7,
      "text": "that when you see one, you know it.",
      "filename": "segment048.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 115.8,
      "end": 117.36,
      "text": "And I know that it is a truth",
      "filename": "segment049.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 117.36,
      "end": 119.34,
      "text": "that real learning took place at South Harmon.",
      "filename": "segment050.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 119.34,
      "end": 120.88,
      "text": "Whether you like it or not, it did.",
      "filename": "segment051.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 121.34,
      "end": 123.14,
      "text": "Because you don't need teachers or classrooms",
      "filename": "segment052.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 123.14,
      "end": 126.14,
      "text": "or fancy highbrow traditions or money to really learn.",
      "filename": "segment053.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 126.24,
      "end": 128.28,
      "text": "You just need people with a desire to better themselves.",
      "filename": "segment054.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 128.46,
      "end": 131.08,
      "text": "And we got that by the shit out of you at South Harmon.",
      "filename": "segment055.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 131.28,
      "end": 133.38,
      "text": "So you can go ahead. Sign your forms.",
      "filename": "segment056.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 133.88,
      "end": 136.16,
      "text": "Reject us and shoot us down and do whatever you gotta do.",
      "filename": "segment057.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 136.58,
      "end": 138.04,
      "text": "It doesn't really matter at this point.",
      "filename": "segment058.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 138.16,
      "end": 140.74,
      "text": "Because we'll never stop learning, and we'll never stop growing.",
      "filename": "segment059.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 141.0,
      "end": 144.3,
      "text": "And we'll never forget the ideals that were instilled in us at our place.",
      "filename": "segment060.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 144.44,
      "end": 147.38,
      "text": "Because we are shitheads now, and we'll be shitheads forever.",
      "filename": "segment061.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 147.38,
      "end": 151.14,
      "text": "And nothing you can say or do or stamp can take that away from us.",
      "filename": "segment062.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 151.18,
      "end": 151.64,
      "text": "So grow!",
      "filename": "segment063.mp4"
    }
  ]
}